{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13428","headline":"题金吾郭将军石洑茅堂 · 常衮","name":"题金吾郭将军石洑茅堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云戟曙沈沈，轩墀清且深。\n家传成栋美，尧宠结茅心。\n玉佩多依石，油幢亦在林。\n炉香诸洞暖，殿影衆山阴。\n草奏风生笔，筵开雪满琴。\n客从龙阙至，僧自虎溪寻。\n潇洒延清赏，周流会素襟。\n终朝惜尘步，一醉见华簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}